Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前 在一个遥远的星系…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:37.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星球大战：最后的绝地武士》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一秩序的统治
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.91,0:00:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁了共和国
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高领袖 斯诺克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始部署他那残酷无情的军队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图重新控制银河系
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯独莱娅·奥加纳舰长与她的抵抗军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,奋起反抗这崛起的暴政
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.98,0:01:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,能确定的是绝地大师卢克·天行者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.49,0:01:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会重燃这场战斗的希望之火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是与此同时抵抗军的位置也暴露了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着第一秩序逼近叛军基地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.02,0:01:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢的英雄们仓促撤离…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的库存还没清空啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not clear yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在C仓还有30组炮弹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are still 30 pallets of cannon shells in C bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹药不要了 我们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the munitions, there's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有人登船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get everyone on the transports.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮到他们了 他们正好要撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've caught them in the middle of their evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高领袖斯诺克有令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my orders from Supreme Leader Snoke himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让他们丧命于此 永不超生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we snuff out the Resistance once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知肯纳迪上尉准备好无畏舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Captain Canady to prime his dreadnought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我烧了他们的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incinerate their base,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁他们的飞船 消灭他们的舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}destroy their transports and obliterate their fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 抵抗军船只接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, Resistance ship approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,火炮和护盾处于战斗状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns and shields in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘轻型战机\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single light fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐观点 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy beeps here, buddy, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可做过比这还疯的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've pulled crazier stunts than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我郑重声明 达默伦指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for the record, Commander Dameron,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我站在机器人这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with the droid on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢您的支持 舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your support, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy beeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是共和国舰队指挥官 波·达默伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Commander Poe Dameron of the Republic fleet,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有紧急事项要与赫克斯舰长通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an urgent communicate for General Hux.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,接进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patch him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是第一秩序 赫克斯舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is General Hux of the First Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.52,0:03:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,共和国已不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Republic is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的舰队只不过是一群叛军渣滓 战争罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fleet are Rebel scum and war criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你珍贵的公主 我们没有谈判余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your precious princess there will be no terms,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我方不接受投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}there will be no surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我在找赫克斯舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm holding for General Hugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是赫克斯 你和你的朋友完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Hux. You and your friends are doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群杂碎很快就会从银河系中消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will wipe your filth from the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 等你转接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Yup. I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听得见我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can he hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫克斯 - 他听得见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hux? - He can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓赫的 瘦瘦高高的小白脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}With an "H." Skinny guy. Kinda pasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听得见你 你听得见我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear you. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不等了 如果你们找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I can't hold forever. If you reach him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说莱娅公主有急事跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell him Leia has an urgent message for him…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他是在捉弄你 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe he's tooling with you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是跟他母亲有关的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…about his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,BB-8 冲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8, punch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他朝无畏舰开去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going for the dreadnought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔吼 真带劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woo-hoo! That's got a kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始处理防空炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, taking out the cannons now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰丽 开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tallie, start your approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯纳迪上尉 你怎么不把那只小苍蝇打下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Canady, why aren't you blasting that puny ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只小苍蝇太小了 而且也太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That puny ship is too small and at too close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们五分钟之前就应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to scramble our fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,出动我们的战机\N{\fnArial\fs30}five bloody minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远都击不穿我的装甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll never penetrate our armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是想击穿装甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not trying to penetrate our armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是想损坏我们的防空炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's clearing out our surface cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}One cannon left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部队来咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here comes the parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 我看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Yeah, I see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.52,0:05:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,BB-8 我的武器系统坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8, my weapons systems are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须把最后一门炮炸掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta take out that last cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们的轰炸机就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or our bombers are toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快显显灵 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work your magic, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动火炮充能完毕了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the auto-cannons primed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备就绪 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primed and ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你还在等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸掉那个基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire on the base!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一艘船已升空 撤离行动完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last transport is in the air. The evacuation is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,波 你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it, Poe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 让你的中队撤回来 这样我们就可以离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get your squad back here so we can get out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, General…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能办到的 我们有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this. We have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉那艘无畏舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take out a dreadnought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些可是舰队杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things are fleet killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这么放任不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let it get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上脱离战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disengage now…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官 这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander. That is an or…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,收起你那副紧张兮兮的表情 3PO\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wipe that nervous expression off your face, 3PO.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的舰长 我尽力试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Well, I will certainly try, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧张兮兮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 BB-8\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, BB-8.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.48,0:07:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,机不可失\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,防空炮全部清除 轰炸机跟进\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear! Bring the bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗军轰炸机正在逼近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resistance bombers approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰炸机分队 保持紧凑队形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombers, keep that tight formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:07:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗机分队 全力保护轰炸机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighters, protect the bombers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是每天都能炸到无畏舰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not every day we get a shot at a dreadnought,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家把握机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}so let's make this count.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 蓝色领队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, Blue Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你送我们到那 让他们尝尝厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get us there, we'll give it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 交给我们吧 - 敌机来袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Copy. We're on it. - Fighters incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,炮手 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunners, look alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌机 方位角210\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snubfighters at two-ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们来了 - 保持队形\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're coming in! - Form up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌机来袭 保持好队形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming fighters. Form up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速到攻击速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vector in at attack speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.32,0:08:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉升 - 包抄右侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pull up! - Flank right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.28,0:08:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼救 我们正在下坠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday! Mayday! Mayday! We're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新充能自动火炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recharge the auto-cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对准那艘巡洋舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target their cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了 泰丽 他们正瞄准我们的舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it. Tallie, they've targeted the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,主炮已经进入充能阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}and begun the priming sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,投弹手 准备投放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombardiers, begin your drop sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已看到目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a visual on the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在接近最佳点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're approaching the sweet spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹已激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombs are armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 自动火炮已瞄准 - 40秒后完成充能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Auto-cannons aimed. - Forty seconds to full charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把最后一艘轰炸机干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy that last bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩奇 回话 我们已经错过投弹点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paige, come in. We're over the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你的投弹舱还没有打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't your bay doors open?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最后一艘轰炸机了 全靠你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only bomber left. It's all down to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼克斯 - 佩奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nix! - Paige!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快投弹 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the payload now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹已投放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombs away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,正中目标 无畏舰已摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Direct hit! Dreadnought down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 最高领袖斯诺克\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, Supreme Leader Snoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从母舰打来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}is making contact from his ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,接到我的房间来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it in my chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫克斯舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Hux.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 你好 最高领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, good. Supreme Lea…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}My disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your performance cannot be overstated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是逃不掉的 最高领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't get away, Supreme Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经是瓮中之鳖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have them tied on the end of a string.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的 波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩穿着个漏水服 什么 你的芯片是不是烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Finn naked leaking bag"? What? Did you fry a chip?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 芬恩 好兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn! Finn, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我们先\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Let's…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先去穿件衣服 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get you dressed. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定有成千上万的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have a thousand questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Rey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Skywalker?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Skywalker?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.92,0:15:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是抵抗军的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from the Resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹莱娅公主派我来的 我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister Leia sent me. We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,邱伊 你来这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你会跟我们回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you're coming back with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.56,0:16:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长 上千年隼再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long story. We'll tell you on the Falcon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,千年隼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falcon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Han?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 拴着缰绳 干得好 赫克斯舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tied on a string indeed, General Hux. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快抵抗力量就会落回我们手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Resistance will soon be in our grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 最高领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Supreme Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我为何让这个偏激的坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wonder why I keep a rabid cur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐上这么高的位子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}in such a place of power?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:17:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个坏蛋的弱点 只要精心操控\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cur's weakness, properly manipulated,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,便能成为一把利剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be a sharp tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伤怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大的凯洛·伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mighty Kylo Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我找到你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I found you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了所有大师心心念念的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what all masters live to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大而野性的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raw, untamed power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.24,0:17:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这力量的背后 却尤其特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}And beyond that, something truly special.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你血统的潜力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The potential of your bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个新的维达\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new Vader.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将自己的全部奉献给了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given everything I have to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了黑暗面\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那可笑的玩意摘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that ridiculous thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲的善还是占据着你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have too much of your father's heart in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的索洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}young Solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了 汉·索洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Han Solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个时候 我根本没有犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the moment came, I didn't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.04,0:18:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在看看你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.68,0:18:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事还让你魂不守舍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the deed split your spirit to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经失衡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were unbalanced,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,败给了一个连光剑都没摸过的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}bested by a girl who had never held a lightsaber!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,输得一败涂地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要天行者还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skywalker lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士的种子就还可能发芽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seed of the Jedi Order lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as long as it does,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系就会死灰复燃\N{\fnArial\fs30}hope lives in the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为你会掐灭这火花\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you would be the one to snuff it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 你不是维达\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you're no Vader.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.28,0:19:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能躲在面具下\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好我的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.28,0:19:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯洛·伦心中已经没有光明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no light left in Kylo Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只会日益强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's only getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一秩序会在数周内控制主要系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Order will control all the major systems within weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要绝地武士回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the Jedi Order back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要卢克·天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need Luke Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不需要卢克·天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need Luke Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有听到我刚说的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear a word I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拿着一把激光剑跟你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna walk out with a.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.77,0:20:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后只身对抗整个第一秩序吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}laser sword and face down the whole First Order?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.84,0:20:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you think was going to happen here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我是无缘无故\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑到这个隐蔽的地方来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the most unfindable place in the galaxy for no reason at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.52,0:20:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.52,0:20:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不请到你 我是不会离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.28,0:21:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是白费功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.24,0:23:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.16,0:24:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是数万年前建的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built a thousand generations ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.60,0:24:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保存这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep these.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.64,0:24:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地典籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}The original Jedi texts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.60,0:24:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我一样 这些都是最后的绝地信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like me, they're the last of the Jedi religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.88,0:24:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你见过这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.40,0:24:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过这座岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只在梦里见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only in dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.28,0:24:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗军派我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Resistance sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.44,0:24:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们派你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.04,0:24:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么特别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's special about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.88,0:24:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从哪来的 - 无名之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you from? - Nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总有一个名字 - 贾库\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one's from nowhere. - Jakku.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.00,0:24:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那的确是无名之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that is pretty much nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.96,0:24:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为何而来 来自无名之地的蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here, Rey, from nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.72,0:24:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗军派我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Resistance sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.12,0:24:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一秩序已经势不可挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Order's become unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.60,0:25:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我内心一直存在某些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something inside me has always been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.48,0:25:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在它们醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now it's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.28,0:25:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.96,0:25:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.72,0:25:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.72,0:25:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.92,0:25:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一个老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.08,0:25:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我教不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.04,0:25:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.44,0:25:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你每天根本就不忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen your daily routine. You're not busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.56,0:25:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再训练下一代绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never train another generation of Jedi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.76,0:25:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这座岛就是为了等死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to this island to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.60,0:25:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候 让绝地终结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for the Jedi to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.52,0:25:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.92,0:25:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅满怀希望地派我来此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia sent me here with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.56,0:25:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她错了 总得给她一个解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she was wrong, she deserves to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也给我们一个解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.40,0:26:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被降职了 - 什么 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're demoted. - What? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.60,0:26:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们摧毁了一艘无畏舰 - 那代价是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We took down a dreadnought. - At what cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你展开一场战斗 就应该战斗到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start an attack, you follow it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.88,0:26:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,波 把你的脑子从驾驶舱拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe, get your head out of your cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.64,0:26:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事情不是你跳进X翼战机\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things that you cannot solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.84,0:26:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后狂轰滥炸就能解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}by jumping in an X-wing and blowing something up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.92,0:26:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须明白这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to learn that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.96,0:26:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场任务里有很多英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were heroes on that mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.92,0:26:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.16,0:26:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}No leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.96,0:26:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道这是哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're really nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.12,0:26:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊该如何找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Rey gonna find us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.48,0:27:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐蔽信标\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cloaked binary beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.04,0:27:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,照亮她的返家之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}To light her way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.08,0:27:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 在她回来之前 我们的计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so until she gets back, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.28,0:27:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要找到一个新基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find a new base.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.24,0:27:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,新基地必须能够提供充足电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}One with enough power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.40,0:27:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,便于发送救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get a distress signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.77,0:27:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给分散在外环的盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}to our allies scattered in the Outer Rim.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.04,0:27:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫近警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proximity alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.08,0:27:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.28,0:27:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.20,0:27:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是斯诺克的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Snoke's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.20,0:27:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在和我开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.04,0:27:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以超空间跳跃吗 - 我们的燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we jump to lightspeed? - We have enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.52,0:27:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只够跳一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}fuel resources for just one jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.00,0:27:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就跳吧 我们必须离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, do it. We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.36,0:27:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.80,0:27:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们通过光速轨道追踪上了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've tracked us through lightspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.64,0:27:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.16,0:27:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.96,0:27:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们确实做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.80,0:27:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果我们超空间跳跃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we jump through lightspeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.92,0:27:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将再次找到我们 到时候燃料耗尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll just find us again and we'll be out of fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.84,0:28:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有束手就擒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.00,0:28:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 还没到那种地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.08,0:28:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我驾驶X翼战机轰炸他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission to jump in an X-wing and blow something up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.28,0:28:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,批准你的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.84,0:28:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,上将 迂回过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, swing us around!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.48,0:28:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速向后 旋转护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full astern. Rotate shields!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.76,0:28:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your stations! Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.68,0:28:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.60,0:28:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色中队前往出发位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green Squadron to launch position.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.28,0:28:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理发射轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear all launch traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.00,0:28:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用等我 跳上飞机后直接发动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wait for me! Jump in and fire her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.28,0:28:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technicians,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.93,0:28:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,限制补给 留待发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}lock down supplies for launch conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.04,0:29:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.64,0:29:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,波 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.20,0:29:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得撤到歼星射程之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get out of range of those Star Destroyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.56,0:29:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.12,0:29:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎全速向前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full engines ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.64,0:29:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们撤到歼星射程之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of range of the Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.09,0:29:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌方就会撤回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroyers and the fighters will fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.48,0:29:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体船舰 全速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}All craft, full engines!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.32,0:29:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,将护盾集中在飞船尾部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate rear shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.84,0:30:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦 抵抗军已经撤离到我们射程之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ren, the Resistance have pulled out of range.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.08,0:30:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的距离我们无法掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't cover you at this distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.76,0:30:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快返回舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.96,0:31:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果连三艘小巡洋舰都没能歼灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the point of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.52,0:31:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们这次追击还有什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we can't blow up three tiny cruisers?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.08,0:31:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的飞船更轻 速度也更快 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're faster and lighter, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.24,0:31:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们甩不掉我们 但是也能和拉开一段距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't lose us, but they can keep at a range.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.20,0:31:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们的炮塔无法击穿他们的护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}where our cannons are ineffective against their shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.96,0:31:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续轰炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, keep up the barrage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.84,0:31:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这至少可以提醒他们 我们仍然在追击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's at least remind them that we're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.52,0:31:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.76,0:31:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这样消耗燃料是撑不了多久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't last long burning fuel like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.32,0:31:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁他们只是时间的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.88,0:32:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 别挡道 所有人 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Out of the way, everybody! Give room!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.04,0:32:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命体征微弱 但是她还有一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life signs are weak, but she's fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.68,0:34:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.52,0:34:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.00,0:34:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.56,0:34:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.40,0:34:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这是座神圣的岛屿 说话注意点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sacred island, watch the language.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.96,0:34:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.72,0:34:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想让你明白现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could make you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.72,0:34:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.44,0:34:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都无法改变我的心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can make me change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.08,0:34:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 你在克隆人之战中效忠我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years ago, you served my father in the Clone Wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.96,0:34:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他请求您帮助他对抗帝国的侵略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he begs you to help him in his struggle against the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.68,0:34:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret that I am unable to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.50,0:34:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法亲自向您转达他的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}present my father's request to you in person…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.96,0:34:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招真是低级\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a cheap move.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.64,0:34:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的飞船遭受了攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but my ship has fallen under attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.20,0:34:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕无法带您回到奥德兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm afraid my mission to bring you to Alderaan has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.80,0:34:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们最危急的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our most desperate hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.92,0:34:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,请您帮帮我 欧比旺·克诺比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, Obi-Wan Kenobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.56,0:34:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我唯一的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.16,0:35:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天天亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.56,0:35:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,三堂课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.04,0:35:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会教你绝地武士之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will teach you the ways of the Jedi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.32,0:35:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会告诉你为什么它该终结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and why they need to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.24,0:35:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥加纳舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Organa,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.56,0:35:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.88,0:35:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然没有意识 但在逐渐恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}is unconscious but recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.96,0:35:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是目前唯一的好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only good news I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.64,0:35:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿克巴上将 我们所有的领导人 都牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Ackbar, all our leadership, they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.16,0:35:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅是战舰上唯一一位生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia was the sole survivor on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.24,0:35:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear. Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.60,0:35:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她在这儿 她会告诉大家等战斗结束再难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she were here, she'd say save your sorrow for after the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.92,0:35:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了完成大业\N{\fnArial\fs30}To that end,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.04,0:36:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,明显 应有人接替她的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}the chain of command is clear as to who should take her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.92,0:36:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是宁卡号巡洋舰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vice Admiral Holdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.00,0:36:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍尔朵中将\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the cruiser Ninka.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.84,0:36:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您 指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.60,0:36:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三艘舰船上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four hundred of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,四百人\N{\fnArial\fs30}on three ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.00,0:36:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是抵抗军仅存的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the very last of the Resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.60,0:36:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们并不孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.00,0:36:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在银河系的每个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}In every corner of the galaxy,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,被压迫的人们都知道我们的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}the downtrodden and oppressed know our symbol,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.44,0:36:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将希望寄托于我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they put their hope in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.96,0:36:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是那星星之火\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.64,0:36:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,势必复兴共和国\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will light the fire that will restore the Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.24,0:36:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点星星之火 也就是我们抵抗军 必须存续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That spark, this Resistance, must survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.72,0:36:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.36,0:36:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 请回到你的岗位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, to your stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.24,0:36:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿原力与我们同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may the Force be with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.00,0:37:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位就是霍尔朵中将\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Admiral Holdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.28,0:37:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥柴仑之战的霍尔朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battle of Chyron Belt Admiral Holdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.68,0:37:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我想象的的不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.28,0:37:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍尔朵中将 我是指挥官达默伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vice Admiral? Commander Dameron.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.80,0:37:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我们目前燃料的消耗\N{\fnArial\fs30}With our current fuel consumption,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.15,0:37:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,避开歼星舰射程的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a very limited amount of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.80,0:37:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间非常有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we can stay out of range of those Star Destroyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.68,0:37:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢你的提醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very kind of you to make me aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.44,0:37:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把燃料消耗情况汇报给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get me those fuel projections.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.60,0:37:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找到新基地前 我们必须甩掉他们 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need to shake 'em before we can find a new base, so,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.00,0:37:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's our plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.52,0:37:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划 上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our plan, captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.20,0:37:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在不是指挥官 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not commander, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.04,0:37:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅的最后一道命令不是对你降级么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't it Leia's last official act to demote you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.36,0:37:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你的无畏舰计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your dreadnought plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.44,0:37:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们损失了整支轰炸舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we lost our entire bombing fleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.16,0:37:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Captain." "Commander."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.56,0:37:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想叫我什么都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call me whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.04,0:37:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想知道现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.36,0:37:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.00,0:37:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.60,0:37:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对付过很多像你一样好战的飞行员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've dealt with plenty of trigger-happy flyboys like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.04,0:37:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意气用事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're impulsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.92,0:37:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,莽撞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.40,0:38:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在最忌讳这样行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the last thing we need right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.04,0:38:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你最好本分点 听从我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stick to your post and follow my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.04,0:38:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,七号和八号机组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turbolink banks seven and eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.96,0:38:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在维护 暂停使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}are offline due to maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.60,0:38:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.04,0:38:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.92,0:39:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我只是在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I was… You know, I was just…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.60,0:39:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Finn!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.48,0:39:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个芬恩 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Finn? - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.60,0:39:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我整天都在和管道打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work behind pipes all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.60,0:39:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太擅长与你这样的英雄交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing talking with Resistance heroes is not my forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.28,0:39:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.64,0:39:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.96,0:39:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫罗丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.80,0:39:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.00,0:39:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.28,0:39:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是抵抗军的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not a Resistance hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.89,0:39:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你聊天很高兴 罗丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was nice talking to you, Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.16,0:39:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿原力与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Force be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.76,0:39:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.52,0:39:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 不过你确实是一位英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. But you are a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.12,0:39:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从第一秩序叛逃 还有在弑星者基地干的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left the First Order, what you did on the Starkiller Base…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.24,0:39:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们听到这些时 我妹妹佩奇说道\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we heard about it, my sister Paige said,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.88,0:39:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝 那才是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Rose, that's a real hero."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.08,0:39:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,明辨是非\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Know right from wrong"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.28,0:39:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使每况愈下 他也不会逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And don't run away when it gets hard, " She said.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.28,0:39:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.40,0:39:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅今天早上 我就打昏了三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just this morning, I've had to stun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.20,0:39:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们想搭逃生舱逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}three people trying to jump ship in this escape pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.64,0:39:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 他们要逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - They were running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.08,0:40:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,太丢脸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's disgraceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.20,0:40:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.32,0:40:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.48,0:40:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得继续我刚刚没做完的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta get back to what I was doing, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.32,0:40:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.24,0:40:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.52,0:40:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做一些检查 - 检查逃生舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doing some checks. - Checking the escape pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.52,0:40:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这只是例行检查 - 你所谓的检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's routine checks. - By boarding one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.64,0:40:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是带着行李登上逃生舱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a packed bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.76,0:40:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.92,0:40:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.72,0:40:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我动不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't move. I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.80,0:40:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.84,0:40:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要送你去关禁闭 谁让你当逃兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking you to the brig and turning you in for desertion.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.80,0:40:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是逃兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not deserting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.12,0:40:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我告诉你 - 我妹妹为了保护舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you that… - My sister just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.52,0:40:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}protecting the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.28,0:40:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却要逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.24,0:40:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.76,0:40:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这支舰队注定难逃一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this fleet is doomed,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.84,0:40:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我的朋友回来了 她也会丧生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if my friend comes back to it, she's doomed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.40,0:40:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须把这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotta get this…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.00,0:40:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须把这个信标带离这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get this beacon far away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.04,0:41:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样她找到我后 就能免于一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she'll find me and be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.24,0:41:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个自私的叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a selfish traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.56,0:41:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甩不掉第一秩序的舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can't outrun the First Order fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.48,0:41:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以超空间跳跃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can jump to lightspeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.92,0:41:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以通过光速轨道追踪到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they can track us through lightspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.56,0:41:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以追踪到我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can track us through lightspeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.64,0:41:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.72,0:41:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们三十秒后就能追上我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd just show up thirty seconds later.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.80,0:41:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们却耗掉了大量的燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'd have blown a ton of fuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.88,0:41:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,更何况我们燃料严重不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, by the way, we're dangerously short on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.68,0:41:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以追踪到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can track us through lightspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.72,0:41:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他们还可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. And they could…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.24,0:41:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的舌头失去知觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't feel my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.80,0:41:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用什么枪射我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you shoot me with?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.36,0:41:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,主动追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Active tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.52,0:41:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.20,0:41:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,超空间追踪是一项新技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyperspace tracking is new tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.44,0:41:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的原理与其它主动追踪器一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the principle must be the same as any active tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.12,0:41:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们就只能通过 - 只能通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're only tracking us… - Only tracking us…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.88,0:41:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,主舰追踪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from the lead ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.32,0:41:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们无法接近追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can't get to the tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.80,0:41:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个A级程序 他们从主舰桥上控制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an A-class process, they'll control it from the main bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.00,0:41:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 不过每个A级程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, yes, but every A-class process…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.48,0:41:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有一个专用的电源断路器\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has a dedicated power breaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.40,0:41:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 谁知道歼星舰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… Wait, but who knows where the breaker room.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.96,0:41:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,配电室在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}is on a Star Destroyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.24,0:41:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前经常在那晃悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the guy that used to mop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.60,0:41:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can get us there,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.32,0:41:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能将他们的追踪器关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can shut their tracker down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.68,0:41:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我简单明了地解释一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give it to me one more time, simpler.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.80,0:41:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the First Order's only.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.01,0:41:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能通过主歼星舰来追踪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}tracking us from one Destroyer, the lead one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.28,0:42:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们去炸掉那艘战舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we blow that one up?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.52,0:42:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个想法很好 但是这样行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like where your head's at, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.88,0:42:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还能用其他主舰追踪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd only start tracking us from another Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.72,0:42:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果我们能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we can…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.80,0:42:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能偷偷登上主舰 关闭追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we sneak on board the lead Destroyer and disable the tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.08,0:42:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知不觉地 我们就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}without them realizing, then we can…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.44,0:42:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在一个系统周期内 是不会察觉到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't realize it's off for one system cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.68,0:42:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大约有六分钟的时间 - 偷偷登舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About six minutes. - Sneak on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.40,0:42:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disable the tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.32,0:42:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的舰队就可以悄悄逃离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fleet escapes before they realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.92,0:42:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.92,0:42:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两是怎么认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you two meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.88,0:42:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰巧遇见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.64,0:42:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.00,0:42:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,算好运吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.68,0:42:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.32,0:42:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,波 我们必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe, we gotta do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.84,0:42:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样既能救舰队也能救蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll save the fleet and it'll save Rey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.80,0:42:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我要发出这里唯一的理性声音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I must be the sole voice of reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.52,0:42:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍尔朵绝对不会同意这个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Holdo will never agree to this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.88,0:42:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对 3P0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right, Threepio.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.48,0:42:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个「秘密计划」 不必向她请示\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a "Need-to-know" Plan, and she doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.20,0:42:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是这个意思 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That wasn't exactly my… - All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.00,0:43:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩去关闭追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}you guys shut down that tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.52,0:43:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿准备超空间跳跃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be here to jump us to lightspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.16,0:43:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.32,0:43:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何偷偷登上斯诺克的歼星舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do we sneak the two of you onto Snoke's Destroyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.56,0:43:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以去偷通行码\N{\fnArial\fs30}We steal clearance codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.72,0:43:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 那是生物密码 每小时更换一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're bio-hexacrypt and rescrambled every hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.56,0:43:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能悄无声息地通过安全护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't get through their security shields undetected.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.80,0:43:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody can.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.88,0:43:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以办到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.56,0:43:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然可以 但我现在没办法帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I could do it. But I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.16,0:43:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在脱不开身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little tied down right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.92,0:43:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.28,0:43:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛兹 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maz? What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.28,0:43:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,联盟内讧 我说了你们也不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Union dispute. You do not want to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.72,0:43:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 你们走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, lucky for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.64,0:43:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好有个我信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's exactly one guy I.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.04,0:43:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能破解那种安全机制\N{\fnArial\fs30}trust who can crack that kind of security!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.88,0:43:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是解码大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a master codebreaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.72,0:43:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌飞行员 还是一个爆破高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}an ace pilot, a poet with a blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.32,0:43:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.52,0:43:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来这位解码兄弟无所不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like this codebreaker fellow can do everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.92,0:43:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.80,0:43:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去找他 这人西服翻领上有朵红花\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find him with a red plom bloom on his lapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.92,0:44:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,正身处坎托湾赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}rolling at a high stakes table.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.88,0:44:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在赌桌上豪赌呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the casino on Canto Bight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.04,0:44:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎托湾 不行 那是 玛兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canto Bight? No, no. That's… Maz…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.20,0:44:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有什么办法让我们自己解决这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any way that we can take care of this ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.20,0:44:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 孩子 这是非常罕见的破解法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, kiddo. This is rarefied cracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.40,0:44:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想登上那艘星舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get on that Destroyer,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.88,0:44:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道这一种方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only know one option.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.92,0:44:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那个解码大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the Master Codebreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.76,0:45:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会带我找到卢克·天行者的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll bring Luke Skywalker to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.36,0:45:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么做 会遭到反噬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not doing this. The effort would kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.64,0:46:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到我周围的环境吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see my surroundings?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.88,0:46:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会为你所做的一切付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna pay for what you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.56,0:46:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到你的环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.52,0:46:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.96,0:46:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.00,0:46:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这其中有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.32,0:46:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.68,0:46:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.04,0:46:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在清理我的枪 不小心走火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was cleaning my blaster. It went off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.48,0:46:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.80,0:46:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些东西是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who were those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.08,0:46:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caretakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.56,0:46:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,岛上的原住民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Island natives.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.84,0:46:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地建筑建成后 他们就一直负责看守\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've kept up the Jedi structures since they were built.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.96,0:47:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们不喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think they like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.68,0:47:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想不到为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't imagine why.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.32,0:47:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Skywalker,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.16,0:47:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要绝地武士回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need you to bring the Jedi back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.48,0:47:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为凯洛·伦体内有很强的黑暗原力\N{\fnArial\fs30}because Kylo Ren is strong with the dark side of the Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.44,0:47:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有绝地武士的话 我们根本没有机会打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the Jedi, we won't stand a chance against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.08,0:47:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对原力知道多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about the Force?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.92,0:47:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是绝对武士拥有的力量 可以控制别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a power that Jedi have that lets them control people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.48,0:47:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以让物体漂浮起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make things float.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.00,0:47:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.16,0:47:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你说的没有一句是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every word in that sentence was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.64,0:48:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一课 双腿盘坐在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lesson one, sit here, legs crossed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.72,0:48:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,原力不是你所拥有的一种力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force is not a power you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.96,0:48:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,和举起石头也没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about lifting rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.64,0:48:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是万物之间的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the energy between all things,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.64,0:48:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种张力 一种平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}a tension, a balance,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.88,0:48:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,能使宇宙万物凝结起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that binds the universe together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.32,0:48:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.48,0:48:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,它具体是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.12,0:48:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.24,0:48:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.32,0:48:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.76,0:48:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.68,0:48:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.84,0:48:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你感觉到了 - 对 感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You feel it? - Yes, I feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.92,0:48:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就是原力 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the Force. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.08,0:48:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的原力一定很强烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, it must be really strong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.72,0:48:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never felt any…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.88,0:48:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.72,0:48:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的伸出去是指\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meant reach out like…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.60,0:48:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.12,0:49:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.36,0:49:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要呼吸就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.40,0:49:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着你的感觉延伸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach out with your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.00,0:49:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.28,0:49:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The island.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.20,0:49:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.60,0:49:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡和腐烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death and decay,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.48,0:49:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,孕育着新的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}that feeds new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.60,0:49:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.76,0:49:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,寒冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.04,0:49:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.04,0:49:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.36,0:49:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们之间呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And between it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.64,0:49:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.40,0:49:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一股能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}An energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.84,0:49:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种原力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.92,0:49:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你体内呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And inside you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.68,0:49:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.44,0:50:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是一样的一种原力\N{\fnArial\fs30}that same Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.00,0:50:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.96,0:50:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种原力不属于绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Force does not belong to the Jedi.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.36,0:50:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说绝地武士消失 光明就没了 那是夸大其词\N{\fnArial\fs30}To say that if the Jedi die, the light dies, is vanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.32,0:50:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感觉到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.20,0:50:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还有别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.88,0:50:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在岛下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}beneath the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.24,0:50:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.60,0:50:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个黑暗的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dark place.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.88,0:50:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.76,0:50:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,强有力的光明 强有力的黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powerful light, powerful darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.96,0:50:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.84,0:50:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在呼唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.24,0:50:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗它 蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resist it, Rey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.40,0:50:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.20,0:50:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.04,0:51:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你直接走向了黑暗面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went straight to the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.20,0:51:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个地方想给我看什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That place was trying to show me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.92,0:51:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它展现你想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It offered something you needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.36,0:51:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却没有尝试阻止自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't even try to stop yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.84,0:51:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.40,0:51:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何关于你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.52,0:51:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把自己和原力分隔开来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've closed yourself off from the Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.40,0:51:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.12,0:51:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种原始力量我之前只见过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen this raw strength only once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.72,0:51:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是本·索洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Ben Solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.64,0:51:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时并不让我觉得害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't scare me enough then.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.56,0:51:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却让我害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.48,0:51:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.64,0:51:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 中将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.04,0:51:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是些残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passing debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.72,0:52:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的燃料只够用18个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fleet's only got 18 hours of fuel left.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.96,0:52:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.60,0:52:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是联系不上抵抗军吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still can't reach the Resistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.64,0:52:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.52,0:52:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果联系上了 问问他们的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get through, check their status.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.32,0:52:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ask about Finn.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.84,0:52:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么原力会连结我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is the Force connecting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.16,0:52:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.32,0:52:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑劣小人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murderous snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.48,0:52:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了 你输了 我找到天行者了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too late. You lost. I found Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.80,0:52:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉你发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he tell you what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.40,0:53:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我烧毁圣殿的那天晚上 他告诉你原因了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night I destroyed his temple, did he tell you why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.72,0:53:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所了解到的你已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know everything I need to know about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.48,0:53:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.56,0:53:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.76,0:53:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的那种眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have that look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.84,0:53:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那时在树林里一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.32,0:53:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you called me a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.72,0:53:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.08,0:53:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.76,0:53:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.96,0:53:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们登陆 一找到解码大师就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get in, we find this codebreaker, we get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.36,0:53:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解坎托湾这个地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this town? Canto Bight?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.72,0:54:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在书上看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}From stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.08,0:54:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里乌烟瘴气 窝藏着一帮银河系最坏的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a terrible place filled with the worst people in the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.64,0:54:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.88,0:54:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和那两个家伙说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told those two, I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.68,0:54:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是公共海滩 不能停穿梭机\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This is a public beach. You can't park that shuttle here."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.52,0:54:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们却熄了火 大步朝着赌场去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they just lit off toward the casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.24,0:54:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,下注 下注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place your bets. Place your bets.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.88,0:54:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在下的注全部放到桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All bets on the table right now, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.76,0:54:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的赌注放这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place your bets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.44,0:55:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方太赞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, yes! This place is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.20,0:55:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.84,0:55:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛兹说这个解码大师的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maz said this Master Codebreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.39,0:55:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,西装翻领上有朵红花\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have a red plom bloom on his lapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.56,0:55:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到他 然后就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find him and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.48,0:55:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 庄家获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well played. The house wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.80,0:55:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有素质啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your manners, more like?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.88,0:55:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.72,0:55:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,整间赌场都找遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've covered this whole casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.80,0:55:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有戴红花的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero red plom blooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.88,0:55:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人到底在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.28,0:55:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,该不会是那个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were those what I think they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.16,0:56:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些是什么玩意 - 法西骆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are those things? - Fathiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.08,0:56:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没亲眼见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.28,0:56:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看这个地方真漂亮 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this whole place is beautiful. I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.68,0:56:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么讨厌这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you hate it so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.28,0:56:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再近点看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.76,0:56:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我妹妹在贫穷的采矿星系里长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister and I grew up in a poor mining system.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.24,0:56:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一秩序抢走了我们的矿石 来补给军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Order stripped our ore to finance their military.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.92,0:56:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又用我们来测试武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}then shelled us to test their weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.08,0:56:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们夺走了我们的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took everything we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.48,0:56:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这些人是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who do you think these people are?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.52,0:56:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在银河系中只有一种生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one business.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.84,0:56:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让人如此富有\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the galaxy that'll get you this rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.64,0:56:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}War.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.24,0:56:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器卖给第一秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selling weapons to the First Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.60,0:56:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望自己能一拳打倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could put my fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.44,0:56:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个污秽的又美丽的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}through this whole lousy, beautiful town.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.80,0:57:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小红花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red plom bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.08,0:57:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小红花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red plom bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.32,0:57:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,解码大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Master Codebreaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.84,0:57:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是他俩乱停机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, those are the shuttle parkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.60,0:57:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.72,0:57:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们因违反禁停条例27B/6被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are under arrest for parking violation 27B/6.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.32,0:57:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有权保持\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the right to remain…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.40,0:57:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 别说话 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - No, no, no. Not now, Lovey.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.60,0:57:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手气正好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.68,0:59:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lesson two.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.24,0:59:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在绝地武士几近灭绝 他们被神化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that they're extinct, the Jedi are romanticized, deified.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.88,0:59:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你揭开他们的神秘面纱 看到他们的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you strip away the myth and look at their deeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.12,0:59:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能发现 他们的失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}the legacy of the Jedi is failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.48,0:59:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,虚伪和狂妄自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hypocrisy, hubris.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.76,0:59:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.96,0:59:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的原力达到顶峰时 任由达斯·西迪厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the height of their powers, they allowed Darth Sidious to rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.64,0:59:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立起帝国 消灭掉绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}create the Empire, and wipe them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.92,0:59:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是绝地大师一手铸就了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a Jedi Master who was responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.00,0:59:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,达斯·维达这个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the training and creation of Darth Vader.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.28,0:59:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是绝地武士拯救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a Jedi who saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.48,0:59:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他是整个银河系最痛恨的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the most hated man in the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.20,0:59:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你看到他内心的矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you saw there was conflict inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.60,0:59:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信他还存有一丝善念 还可以迷途知返\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believed that he wasn't gone. That he could be turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.56,0:59:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就成了一个传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I became a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.60,0:59:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年 都保持着平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}For many years, there was balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.92,0:59:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.60,0:59:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.04,1:00:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的外甥 身上流淌着天行者的血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}My nephew with that mighty Skywalker blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.88,1:00:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后狂妄自大的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in my hubris,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.40,1:00:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为自己可以训练他 将我的力量传给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I could train him, I could pass on my strengths.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.76,1:00:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉是汉 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han was Han about it, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.64,1:00:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.60,1:00:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的儿子交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}trusted me with her son.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.76,1:00:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收他为徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took him,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.80,1:00:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有十几个学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a dozen students,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.60,1:00:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立了一座训练神殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and began a training temple.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.28,1:00:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I realized.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.40,1:00:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己无法打败他内心滋生的黑暗时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was no match for the darkness rising in him,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.20,1:00:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.08,1:00:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.88,1:00:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去和他对峙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to confront him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.64,1:00:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他攻击了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he turned on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.72,1:00:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.32,1:00:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定以为我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have thought I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.12,1:01:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我醒来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I came to,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.44,1:01:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,神殿着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the temple was burning.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.56,1:01:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带着我的几个学生消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had vanished with a handful of my students.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.32,1:01:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且残忍地屠杀了其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And slaughtered the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.96,1:01:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅觉得是斯诺克的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia blamed Snoke,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.64,1:01:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.60,1:01:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.52,1:01:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是卢克·天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was Luke Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.48,1:01:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jedi Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.72,1:01:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}A legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.60,1:01:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系也许需要一个传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The galaxy may need a legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.48,1:01:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也需要有人来告诉我 要在其中扮演什么角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need someone to show me my place in all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.60,1:01:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没有辜负凯洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't fail Kylo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.52,1:01:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是凯洛让你失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kylo failed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.88,1:02:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.24,1:02:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,主舰仍然在射程外\N{\fnArial\fs30}The main cruiser's still keeping beyond range.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.56,1:02:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们的医疗护卫舰燃料已经用尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But their medical frigate is out of fuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.52,1:02:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们的护盾也倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and its shields are down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.44,1:02:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的死期到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beginning of their end.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.80,1:02:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.60,1:02:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们剩下的队员 已经朝你们的方向撤退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last of our crew has been evacuated and heading your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.96,1:02:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸为您效力 中将\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been an honor, admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.76,1:02:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天佑叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godspeed, Rebels!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.00,1:02:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,中将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.76,1:02:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料只能维持6个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}fuel reserves at six hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.52,1:02:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续我们现在的航线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maintain our current course.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.40,1:02:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳步前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.16,1:03:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.32,1:03:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝 你们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose, where are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.80,1:03:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,加我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.08,1:03:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.04,1:03:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 星舰的燃料即将耗尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, the fleet is running on fumes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.12,1:03:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有解码大师帮我们登上敌舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without a codebreaker to break us onto Snoke's Star Destroyer…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.08,1:03:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么办 - 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do we do? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.24,1:03:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非凭空变出个盗贼来 否则我们的计划就泡汤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you got a thief in your pocket, our plan is shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.92,1:03:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.40,1:03:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.08,1:03:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.16,1:03:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.32,1:03:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-S-Sorry, I just.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.32,1:03:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是要故意偷听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't help but overhear all the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.44,1:03:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们说得太大声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you were saying really loudly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.08,1:03:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正想要睡觉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I was trying to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.64,1:03:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,解码大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Codebreaker?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.00,1:04:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thief?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.40,1:04:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.76,1:04:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是在说偷钱包 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not talking about picking pockets, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.56,1:04:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.44,1:04:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要以貌取人 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}D-D-Don't let the wrapper fool you, friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.12,1:04:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老早就和第一秩序的密码打交道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and the First Order codeage go way back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.56,1:04:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.32,1:04:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果价钱合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the price is right,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.52,1:04:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能带你们 进老怪物斯诺克的卧室看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could break you into old man S-S-Snoke's boudoir.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.16,1:04:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我们 我们能处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - We're… We got it covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.68,1:04:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha-tuk-ga.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.44,1:04:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他刚才是不是 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he just… - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.76,1:04:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out of here! This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.56,1:04:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 你这个小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you little…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.76,1:05:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}D-D-Did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.68,1:05:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.88,1:05:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 举起手来 - 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hands up! - Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.24,1:05:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么来头 圆滚滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your story, roundie?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.56,1:05:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去这边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went this way!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.40,1:05:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 封锁所有出口 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lock down all the exits. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.96,1:05:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来真香\N{\fnArial\fs30}That smelled great.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.72,1:05:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察随时都可能来 现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those cops will be here any minute. What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.20,1:05:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.88,1:06:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等一下 请别按\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. Please, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.00,1:06:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是抵抗军\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're with the Resistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.24,1:06:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 立刻检查马厩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. Checking the stables now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.12,1:06:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.20,1:06:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have come through here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.36,1:06:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.24,1:07:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快 快 呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.36,1:07:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑了 别笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop enjoying this! Stop enjoying this!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.36,1:07:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到他们了 他们跑不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got them. They're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.68,1:07:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.76,1:07:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.84,1:08:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 走开 快让道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, move! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.28,1:08:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的飞船在海滩上 往前直走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our ship's on the beach straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.52,1:08:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.40,1:08:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.20,1:08:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.00,1:08:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.08,1:08:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管兽群了 跟紧罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the herd go. Stick with the perps.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.64,1:09:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.92,1:09:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甩掉他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we lost him!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.16,1:09:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在去海滩 再绕一圈回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we get down to the beach and circle back around…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.00,1:09:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,悬崖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cliff!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.16,1:09:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.16,1:09:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was worth it, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.00,1:09:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tear up that town,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.64,1:09:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,搅得天翻地覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}make 'em hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.48,1:09:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.52,1:09:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在才值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.04,1:10:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.68,1:10:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,BB-8 等一下 你居然会开飞船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8! Wait, are you flying that thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.96,1:10:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.24,1:10:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要搭顺风车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-N-Need a lift?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.80,1:11:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.12,1:11:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.12,1:11:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather not do this now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.68,1:11:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.40,1:11:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么恨你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you hate your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.44,1:11:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have something,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.56,1:11:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,披上件斗篷什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}a cowl or something you could put on?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.72,1:11:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么恨你的父亲 说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you hate your father? Give me an honest answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.60,1:11:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一个爱你的父亲 他关心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a father who loved you, he gave a damn about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.32,1:11:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不恨他 - 那为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't hate him. - Then why?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.76,1:11:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why what?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.28,1:11:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么怎样 说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why what? Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.04,1:11:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.16,1:12:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.56,1:12:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.92,1:12:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.08,1:12:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母把你当个垃圾扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents threw you away like garbage.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.88,1:12:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们没有 - 他们就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They didn't! - They did.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.12,1:12:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你仍然需要他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't stop needing them.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.08,1:12:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你最大的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your greatest weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.16,1:12:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处寻找他们的影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for them everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.40,1:12:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是汉·索洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Han Solo,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.08,1:12:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}now in Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.28,1:12:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉你那个晚上发什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he tell you what happened that night?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.44,1:12:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.52,1:12:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.36,1:12:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他感受到了我的原力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had sensed my power,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.32,1:12:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他感受到了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}as he senses yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.32,1:12:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他害怕这种力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he feared it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.84,1:12:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liar.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.56,1:13:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让过去安息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the past die.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.52,1:13:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,必要时 就杀掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill it if you have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.40,1:13:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你才能完成自己的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only way to become what you were meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.32,1:13:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.72,1:14:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.20,1:15:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该感受到困惑或恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have felt trapped or panicked.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.04,1:15:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.92,1:15:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会永远持续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This didn't go on forever,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.00,1:15:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道它会指向一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it was leading somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.92,1:15:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终 它会让我看到心中所想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, at the end, it would show me what I came to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.56,1:15:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.48,1:15:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.16,1:15:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.32,1:15:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}please.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.52,1:16:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我会在这里找到答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd find answers here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.20,1:16:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.12,1:16:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未感到如此孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never felt so alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.40,1:16:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.92,1:16:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.28,1:16:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.40,1:16:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.80,1:17:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.20,1:17:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真的吗 你想杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true? Did you try to murder him?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.28,1:17:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave this island now!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.88,1:18:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.36,1:18:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.92,1:18:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.20,1:18:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你铸就了凯洛·伦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you create Kylo Ren?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.88,1:18:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.68,1:18:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw darkness.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.44,1:18:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到他体内的黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd sensed it building in him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.52,1:18:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他训练的时候看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd seen it in moments during his training.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.68,1:18:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我看得更深时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I looked inside,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.96,1:19:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,却发现它已远远超出我的想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was beyond what I ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.96,1:19:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺克已经扭曲了他的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snoke had already turned his heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.80,1:19:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他内心的黑暗会带来毁灭 伤痛 和死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would bring destruction, and pain, and death,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.64,1:19:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁我爱的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the end of everything I love because of what he will become.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.76,1:19:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那一瞬间 我出于本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the briefest moment of pure instinct,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.72,1:19:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我可以阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I could stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.08,1:19:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而这感觉转瞬而逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It passed like a fleeting shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.44,1:19:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下羞愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was left with shame,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.64,1:19:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,和悔恨的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with consequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.36,1:19:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到最后一幕是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the last thing I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.76,1:19:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一双充满惶恐的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}were the eyes of a frightened boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.76,1:19:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,被导师辜负的心灰意冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose master had failed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.92,1:19:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.84,1:19:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他误入歧途了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You failed him by thinking his choice was made.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.04,1:19:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.48,1:19:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他内心仍在挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still conflict in him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.44,1:19:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他能弃暗从明 就能扭转整个局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he were turned from the dark side, that could shift the tide.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.24,1:19:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能反败为胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be how we win.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.16,1:20:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情不会像你想的那样发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not going to go the way you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.68,1:20:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.12,1:20:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们双手相触的一刹那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just now when we touched hands,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.04,1:20:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了他的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw his future.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.32,1:20:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我能看到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As solid as I'm seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.44,1:20:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我去找他 本·索洛会改变阵营的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I go to him, Ben Solo will turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.16,1:20:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.76,1:20:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.72,1:20:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会是我们最后的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he's our last hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.40,1:21:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Yoda.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.68,1:21:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.40,1:21:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ending all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.16,1:21:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,原力树 典籍还有绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tree, the text, the Jedi.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.80,1:21:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会烧毁这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna burn it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.84,1:21:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.40,1:22:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.92,1:22:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed you, have I.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.16,1:22:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it is time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.36,1:22:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让绝地武士团终结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Jedi Order to end.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.32,1:22:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.16,1:22:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.28,1:22:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该放下那堆旧书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you to look past a pile of old books, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.96,1:22:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是神圣的绝地典籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sacred Jedi texts.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.88,1:22:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你读过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Read them, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.76,1:22:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 - 令人爱不释手的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I… - Page-turners.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.40,1:22:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were not.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.28,1:22:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.36,1:22:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,书中自有黄金屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wisdom they held,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.84,1:22:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那堆旧书里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that library contained nothing that the girl Rey.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.48,1:22:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊都具备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}does not already possess.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.56,1:23:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skywalker,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.16,1:23:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是着眼于遥远的天边\N{\fnArial\fs30}still looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.24,1:23:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,从不考虑眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never here, now, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.92,1:23:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当下的需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}The need in front of your nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.28,1:23:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.16,1:23:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懦弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.04,1:23:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unwise.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.20,1:23:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经失去了本·索洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost Ben Solo, you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.48,1:23:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,决不能 再失去蕾伊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose Rey, we must not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.36,1:23:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到她希望的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be what she needs me to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.80,1:23:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没听我说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heeded my words not, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.44,1:23:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的所学传于后世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass on what you have learned.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.12,1:23:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的优点 精髓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strength, mastery.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.20,1:23:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But weakness,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.96,1:23:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者愚蠢 和失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}folly, failure also.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.52,1:23:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 尤其是失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, failure most of all.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.80,1:23:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败是最伟大的老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greatest teacher, failure is.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.08,1:23:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.68,1:24:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们日后会超越我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are what they grow beyond.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.84,1:24:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是所有大师真正的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the true burden of all masters.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.28,1:24:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有四秒差距 这真的发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four parsecs to go. This thing really cooks.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.40,1:24:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望我们能及时到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope we're in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.24,1:24:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以做到的 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can actually do this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.20,1:24:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, about that…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.96,1:24:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们 我可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.32,1:24:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是行动的前提 是要谈妥价格\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there exists a pre-"Do it" Conversation about price.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.80,1:24:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦任务完成 抵抗军会给你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we're done, the Resistance will give you whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.04,1:24:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有什么小金库吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got deposit-wise?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.96,1:24:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看起来像暴发户吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me? Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.24,1:24:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是金月牙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Haysian smelt?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.64,1:24:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's something.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.12,1:24:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们保证 你会得到应有的报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we gave you our word. You're gonna get paid.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.44,1:25:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该知足了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.80,1:25:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们 我想要帮助你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I wanna keep helping.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.20,1:25:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们可不能空手套白狼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no something, n-n-no doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.84,1:25:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen here, you've got…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.40,1:25:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,做事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.08,1:25:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我可以继续帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I can help.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.36,1:25:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.92,1:25:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.00,1:25:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.24,1:25:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道这块东西对她意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how much that medallion means to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.68,1:25:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么 你还要洗劫自己的飞船吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you… Why are you ransacking your own ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.16,1:25:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.04,1:25:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是我偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says I stole it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.24,1:25:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听得懂 - 是我们偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I got that. - We stole it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.36,1:25:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你是从坏人手里偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you're stealing from the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.24,1:25:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能帮助正义的一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and helping the good.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.40,1:25:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好人 坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good guys, bad guys,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.52,1:25:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过文字游戏而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}made-up words.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.28,1:25:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看谁是这艘豪华飞船的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see who formerly owned this gorgeous hunk-uh.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.96,1:25:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 这人是个军火商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, this guy was an arms dealer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.96,1:26:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,以售卖军火给坏人为生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made his bank selling weapons to the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.88,1:26:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.48,1:26:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也卖给好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.40,1:26:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 让我来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, let me learn you something big.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.72,1:26:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不过是个机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a machine, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.52,1:26:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由生活 不要加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live free, don't join.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.40,1:26:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他们最后的支援舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the last of their support ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.00,1:26:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,却成了现在的主舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just their main cruiser now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.60,1:26:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还有燃料储备吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their fuel reserve?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.24,1:26:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从计算来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}By our calculation,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.12,1:26:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉襟见肘\N{\fnArial\fs30}critical.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.84,1:26:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.92,1:26:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长已经禁止你出入这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The admiral's banned you from the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.04,1:26:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要胡闹 - 放心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's not have a scene. - No, let's.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.64,1:26:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍尔朵 - 你不能进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holdo? - You're not allowed in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.60,1:26:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 飞行员小子 - 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Flyboy. - Cut it, lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.08,1:26:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前有一个舰队 现在只剩一艘飞船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a fleet, now we're down to one ship,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.88,1:26:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而你却什么都不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you've told us nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.08,1:27:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你已经有计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us that we have a plan!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.48,1:27:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there's hope!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.64,1:27:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我在莱娅手下时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I served under Leia,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.20,1:27:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会说 希望就像一个太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}she would say, hope is like the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.84,1:27:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有相信它 才能看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you only believe in it when you can see it…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.52,1:27:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撑不过今晚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never make it through the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.20,1:27:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.52,1:27:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在给运输船加燃料吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you fueling up the transports?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.16,1:27:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.16,1:27:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.68,1:27:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要放弃主舰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're abandoning ship? Is that…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.68,1:27:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你想出的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you got? That's what you brought us to?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.28,1:27:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coward!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.16,1:27:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些运输船没有武器 没有护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those transport ships are unarmed, unshielded.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.20,1:27:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃了这艘主舰 我们就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We abandon this cruiser, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.64,1:27:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们丧失了机会 不 你不仅是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't stand a chance. No, you are not just a coward,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.52,1:27:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是个叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.76,1:27:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个人带出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this man off my bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.80,1:28:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 霍尔朵要让大家移到运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn, Holdo's loading the crew in the shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.20,1:28:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要放弃主舰了 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going to abandon ship. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.16,1:28:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,波 我们在回舰队的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe, we're on our way back to the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.04,1:28:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're so close.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.36,1:28:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找到那个解码大师了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find the Master Codebreaker?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.56,1:28:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了 一个解码的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we found a codebreaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.12,1:28:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以关闭追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can shut the tracker down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.28,1:28:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我们点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just buy us a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.36,1:28:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.20,1:28:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一发射出去 你就往后 退出他们的射程\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I launch, you jump back out of range.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.12,1:28:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后等我给你集合点的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there until you get my signal for where to rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.68,1:28:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在我之前看到芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see Finn before I do,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.56,1:28:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell him…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.76,1:28:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, perfect. Tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.52,1:29:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动隐身装置 他们就侦查不到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloaking our approach. We should be off their scopes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.64,1:29:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后切开他们的防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we slice a slit in their shield.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.12,1:29:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哔啵 哔啵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blip bloppity bloop,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.80,1:29:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,滑翔进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and slip right through.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.20,1:30:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说突击队员和谁在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a stormtrooper and a who now are doing what?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.48,1:30:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在努力拯救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are trying to save us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.80,1:30:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们撤退的最好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our best chance for escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.60,1:30:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要给芬恩和罗丝最大限度的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to give Finn and Rose all the time that you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.68,1:30:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是让抵抗军的幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have bet the survival of the Resistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.20,1:30:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,命悬一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}on bad odds and put us all at risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.12,1:30:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.48,1:30:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须要放弃主舰 运输机准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get clear of the cruiser. Load the transports.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.56,1:30:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away, admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.64,1:30:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我就知道你会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was afraid you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.84,1:30:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍尔朵中将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vice Admiral Holdo,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.88,1:30:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在解除你对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am relieving you of your command.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.84,1:30:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体人员以及抵抗军的指挥权\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the survival of this ship, its crew, and the Resistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.00,1:30:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好知道你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you understand what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.76,1:30:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.00,1:30:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去那个连接通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.28,1:30:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们有任何异动 打昏他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they move, stun them.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.20,1:31:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前至少还要三周期\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least three cycles so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.12,1:31:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 长官 我们正在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. We are working on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.84,1:31:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽我所能 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will do my best, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.96,1:31:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.32,1:31:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必非要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.64,1:31:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感到你内心的挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel the conflict in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.40,1:31:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正将你撕碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tearing you apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.16,1:31:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 当我们双手相触时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, when we touched hands,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.68,1:31:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了你的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw your future.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.40,1:31:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管只有轮廓 但却准确而清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the shape of it, but solid and clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.36,1:31:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会屈服于斯诺克的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not bow before Snoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.64,1:32:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会叛变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.44,1:32:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.64,1:32:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看的见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.32,1:32:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也看到了些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw something, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.40,1:32:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of what I saw,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.56,1:32:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当那个时机来临时 你才是那个叛变的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know when the moment comes, you'll be the one to turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.72,1:32:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会站到我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll stand with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.20,1:32:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.40,1:32:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了你的父母是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw who your parents are.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.60,1:32:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 我优秀而忠心的好徒儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, my good and faithful apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.08,1:32:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你恢复信心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My faith in you is restored.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.40,1:32:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young Rey.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.76,1:32:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.68,1:32:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.12,1:33:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪器就在这扇门后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tracker's right behind this door.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.20,1:33:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,金月牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haysian smelt.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.76,1:33:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的导体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best conductor.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.76,1:33:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.36,1:33:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候想想该怎么回舰队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good time to figure out how we get back to the fleet?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.28,1:33:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道最近的逃生舱在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where the nearest escape pods are.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.04,1:33:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.12,1:33:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,BB-8 告诉我点好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8, tell me something good.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.80,1:33:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,波 我们马上就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.16,1:33:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备超空间跳跃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have the cruiser prepped for lightspeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.52,1:33:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在做 你要快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm on it, pal. You just hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.96,1:33:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理连接通道 护送军官们去机库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the bridge, escort the officers down to the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.04,1:33:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官 达默伦上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander… Captain Dameron,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.64,1:33:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍尔朵中将在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Holdo was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.68,1:33:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we spoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.28,1:33:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我恐怕要问一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I am almost afraid to ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.68,1:33:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,随心而动 去吧 3PO\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good instinct, Threepio. Go with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.28,1:34:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal that door!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.08,1:34:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.20,1:34:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.60,1:34:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.20,1:34:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO 你要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Threepio, where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.20,1:34:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加兵变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be quite against my programming…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.36,1:34:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,与我的程序设置冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be party to a mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.24,1:34:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是正确的指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not correct protocol.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.84,1:34:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Neither is this!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.44,1:34:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 我们已经准备好进行跳跃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn? We're ready to make the jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.60,1:34:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,机不可失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now or never.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.40,1:34:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.84,1:34:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.64,1:35:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there, hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.72,1:35:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制他们 控制他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch 'em, watch 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.92,1:35:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapons, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.83,1:35:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手 叛军渣滓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up, Rebel scum.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.04,1:35:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 我说趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down! I said, down!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.48,1:35:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,FN-2187\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fn-2187.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.16,1:35:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So good to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.36,1:35:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.40,1:35:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.00,1:35:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请根据疏散指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please board the transports.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.48,1:36:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,登上运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}according to your evacuation designation.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.92,1:36:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理所有的运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}All transports must be cleared…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.00,1:36:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把他推上去吧 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, help me push him up, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.56,1:36:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人是个麻烦精\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one's a troublemaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.68,1:36:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺喜欢他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.64,1:36:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.40,1:36:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 该登上运输机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, time to board your transport.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.56,1:36:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,用于逃亡的运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the transports to escape,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.20,1:36:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须有人待在后方 驾驶巡洋舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone needs to stay behind and pilot the cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.76,1:36:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,损失惨重啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many losses.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.00,1:36:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也再经不起失去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.48,1:36:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.16,1:36:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你教会我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taught me how.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.64,1:36:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿原力\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Force be…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.96,1:36:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续吧 我已经说了太多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go on. I've said it enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.44,1:36:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿原力一直与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Force be with you always.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.64,1:36:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐蔽装置激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloaking device activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.00,1:36:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要躲开他们的侦查\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be off their scopes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.00,1:36:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这个能有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope this works.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.04,1:37:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 过来点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come closer, child.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.12,1:37:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是如此富有力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.00,1:37:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗面一旦升起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darkness rises,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.28,1:37:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,光明面便如影随形\N{\fnArial\fs30}and light to meet it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.92,1:37:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过我年轻的徒弟 他变得越强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned my young apprentice that as he grew stronger,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.16,1:37:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的光明面也就越大\N{\fnArial\fs30}his equal in the light would rise.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.32,1:37:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skywalker…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.48,1:37:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assumed.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.40,1:37:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrongly.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.64,1:37:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你过来点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closer, I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.24,1:37:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你低估了天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You underestimate Skywalker,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.72,1:38:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,本·索洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Ben Solo,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.52,1:38:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.40,1:38:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将会一败涂地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be your downfall.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.44,1:38:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.96,1:38:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen something?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.32,1:38:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我徒弟的一个弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A weakness in my apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.44,1:38:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你来此的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you came?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.20,1:38:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.08,1:38:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我连接了你们的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was I who bridged your minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.20,1:38:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我激化了伦内心的矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stoked Ren's conflicted soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.72,1:38:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他在你面前藏不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew he was not strong enough to hide it from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.00,1:38:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 也还是愚蠢地上钩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were not wise enough to resist the bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.80,1:38:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.68,1:38:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会告诉我天行者的藏身处\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will give me Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.72,1:38:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.36,1:38:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,用最残忍的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the cruelest stroke.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.88,1:38:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.52,1:38:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.80,1:39:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.80,1:39:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.08,1:39:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.24,1:39:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.36,1:39:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.16,1:39:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.28,1:39:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poe.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.08,1:39:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.24,1:39:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,矿物星球 克瑞特\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mineral planet, Crait.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.20,1:39:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图中未标明的起义军隐匿处\N{\fnArial\fs30}An uncharted hideout from the days of the Rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.08,1:39:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是个叛军基地吗 - 废弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a Rebel base? - Abandoned,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.44,1:39:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but heavily armored.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.60,1:39:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕴藏着足够的能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}with enough power.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.68,1:39:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,够让我们向分散在外环的盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get a distress signal to our allies.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.08,1:39:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,发送求救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}scattered in the Outer Rim.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.40,1:39:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍尔朵了解第一秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holdo knew the First Order.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.36,1:39:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在追踪我们的大型战舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was tracking our big ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.68,1:39:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会监视小型运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not monitoring for little transports.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.04,1:39:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们可以悄悄地滑到地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we could slip down to the surface unnoticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.40,1:39:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等第一秩序过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hide till the First Order passes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.84,1:39:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could work.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.56,1:40:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在乎的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was more interested.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.64,1:40:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护光明面\N{\fnArial\fs30}in protecting the light than she was.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.56,1:40:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是去当个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeming like a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.00,1:40:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godspeed,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.56,1:40:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebels.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.72,1:40:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 法斯马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Phasma.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.20,1:40:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好的 你的飞船和酬劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ship and payment, as we agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.84,1:41:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lying snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.28,1:41:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got caught,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.24,1:41:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一笔交 交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cut a d-d-deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.12,1:41:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.84,1:41:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了笔什么交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut a deal with what?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.32,1:41:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们核实这个小偷的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we checked on the information from the thief.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.44,1:41:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做了一次显现扫描 确信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran a decloaking scan, and sure enough,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.04,1:41:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,30驾抵抗军运输机刚从机库起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 Resistance transports have just launched from the cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.56,1:41:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told us the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.52,1:41:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇迹永远屹立不倒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will wonders never cease?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.40,1:41:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,非也\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.84,1:41:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的武器准备就绪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our weapons are ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.00,1:41:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经瞄准 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready and aimed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.20,1:41:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,随意扫射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire at will.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.56,1:41:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不 不 你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. No, no. No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.64,1:41:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.16,1:42:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 我们受到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, we're taking fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.92,1:42:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要掉头吗 - 不 你们离得太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do we turn around? - No, you're too far out.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.52,1:42:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,向着坠落星球全速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full speed to planetfall.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.32,1:42:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full speed!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.12,1:42:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.24,1:42:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没想到天行者这么有智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not expect Skywalker to be so wise.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.60,1:42:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会给他和绝地武士团\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will give him and the Jedi Order.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.36,1:42:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴望的终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}the death he desires.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.36,1:42:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在判军消失之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the Rebels are gone,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.76,1:42:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会去他的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will go to his planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.40,1:42:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁那整片岛屿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and obliterate the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.04,1:42:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有勇无谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such spunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.12,1:42:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.68,1:42:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些运输机上的所有抵抗军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire Resistance on those transports…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.36,1:42:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就会消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon they will all be gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.44,1:43:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 一切成空\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, all is lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.60,1:43:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 还有火热的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. And still that fiery spit of hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.24,1:43:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有着真正的绝地武士精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the spirit of a true Jedi!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.88,1:43:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because of that,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.32,1:43:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.52,1:43:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我优秀的徒儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My worthy apprentice,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.84,1:43:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗面之子 维达大人的继承者\N{\fnArial\fs30}son of darkness, heir apparent to Lord Vader.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.76,1:43:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的挣扎 变成决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there was conflict, I now sense resolve.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.40,1:43:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的弱点 变成力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there was weakness, strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.88,1:43:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成你的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complete your training,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.80,1:43:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,履行你的使命吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fulfill your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.44,1:44:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚我的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.16,1:44:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.96,1:44:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你能感化他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can turn him?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.72,1:44:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic child.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.08,1:44:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会被背叛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot be betrayed,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.68,1:44:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会被打败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot be beaten.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.88,1:44:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到他的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see his mind,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.40,1:44:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚他的每一个意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see his every intent.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.56,1:44:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.08,1:44:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他转动光剑击中敌害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see him turning the lightsaber to strike true.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.32,1:44:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.20,1:44:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}foolish child,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.24,1:44:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会点燃它\N{\fnArial\fs30}he ignites it,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.84,1:44:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死他真正的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kills his true enemy!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.52,1:45:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 推进器全开 全速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, give it full thrusters. Full speed!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.40,1:45:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经开了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.48,1:45:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是谋杀 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You murdering bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.64,1:45:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 大芬\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-T-Take it easy, Big F.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.24,1:45:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,冤冤相报何时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They blow you up today, you blow them up tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.80,1:45:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是交易而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just business.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.00,1:45:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.88,1:45:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.40,1:47:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.68,1:47:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.00,1:47:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快命令他们停止开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order them to stop firing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.16,1:47:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有时间救舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still time to save the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.68,1:47:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.96,1:48:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧秩序该灭亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to let old things die.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.48,1:48:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snoke,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.92,1:48:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.24,1:48:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,西斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sith,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.28,1:48:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士团 还有叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Jedi, the Rebels…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.28,1:48:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,都消失吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it all die.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.28,1:48:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.36,1:48:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你加入我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to join me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.80,1:48:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起 建立新秩序 统治银河系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can rule together and bring a new order to the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.52,1:48:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.08,1:48:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要走入歧途\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't go this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.32,1:48:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 你还在坚持 放手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. You're still holding on! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.96,1:48:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道你父母的真相吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna know the truth about your parents?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.24,1:48:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者你一直都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or have you always known?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.24,1:48:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在逃避而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've just hidden it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.84,1:48:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.20,1:48:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.76,1:48:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.00,1:48:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们谁也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.68,1:48:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是捡破烂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were filthy junk traders.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.48,1:48:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你卖了 来换酒钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}who sold you off for drinking money.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.44,1:49:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终死在贾库的一个贫民墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead in a paupers' grave in the Jakku desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.32,1:49:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这个故事里毫无容身之所\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no place in this story.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.44,1:49:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毫无背景 你什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come from nothing. You're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.76,1:49:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你对我不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.12,1:49:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.60,1:49:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.04,1:50:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.64,1:50:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗军主舰要超空间跳跃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Resistance cruiser's preparing to jump to lightspeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.20,1:50:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.44,1:50:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是想转移我们的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just trying to pull our attention away.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.72,1:50:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.08,1:50:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续对运输机开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your fire on the transports.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.08,1:50:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪毙便宜他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Execution by blaster is too good for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.96,1:50:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们尝点苦头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make this hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.72,1:50:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.36,1:51:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my command.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.76,1:51:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's running away.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.16,1:51:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.24,1:51:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 快向那艘巡洋舰开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Fire on that cruiser!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.04,1:51:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Execute.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.16,1:52:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.40,1:52:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有一架飞船 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a shuttle back that way! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.68,1:52:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.80,1:52:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.12,1:53:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.52,1:53:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是军队的败笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a bug in the system.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.64,1:53:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种就来啊 铁光头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, chrome dome.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.52,1:53:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.32,1:53:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.28,1:54:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.24,1:54:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都是渣滓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always scum.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.44,1:54:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军渣滓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebel scum.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.44,1:54:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 要搭便车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Need a lift?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.44,1:55:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.16,1:55:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩谋杀了斯诺克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl murdered Snoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.28,1:55:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.80,1:55:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她坐上斯诺克的太空船跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took Snoke's escape craft.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.76,1:55:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道她的去向\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know where she's going.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.16,1:55:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合所有的军队去抵抗军基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get all our forces down to that Resistance base.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.36,1:55:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个了断吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.60,1:55:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish this?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.36,1:55:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你在命令谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.88,1:55:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你可以指挥我的军队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You presume to command my army?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.16,1:55:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高领袖已经死了 我们不再有统治者了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Supreme Leader is dead! We have no ruler!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.04,1:55:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的最高领袖已死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Supreme Leader is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.32,1:56:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高领袖 万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live the Supreme Leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.28,1:56:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了 关闭大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming, shut the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.20,1:56:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.48,1:56:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.32,1:56:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关闭盾门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that shield door down!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.12,1:56:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不要开枪 是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Wait, don't shoot! It's us!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.52,1:56:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.72,1:57:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.88,1:57:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别开枪 - 停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't shoot! - Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.48,1:57:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn? Finn!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.28,1:57:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝 你们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose! You're not dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.12,1:57:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的机器人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my droid?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.60,1:57:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.80,1:57:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,能见到你实在是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad to see you!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.72,1:57:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 等等 慢点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what? Wait, wait, wait, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.04,1:57:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下这些人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this all that's left?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.68,1:57:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 护罩已开启 他们在外太空伤害不了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, shields are up so they can't hit us from orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.20,1:57:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我们手里的一切能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use whatever power we've got left.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.60,1:57:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,向外环发送求救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}to broadcast a distress signal to the Outer Rim.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.80,1:57:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的私人电码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use my personal code.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.96,1:57:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果抵抗军还有同盟的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there are any allies to the Resistance,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.36,1:57:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.20,1:57:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝 武器都有哪些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.60,1:57:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,腐烂的弹药 生锈的大炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotting munitions, rusted artillery,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.53,1:57:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇摇晃晃的飞行艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}some half-gutted skim speeders.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.36,1:57:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.36,1:57:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能祈祷那扇大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just pray that big-ass door.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.92,1:57:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够坚持到救援的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}holds long enough for us to get help.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.48,1:58:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,破城锤大炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}A battering ram cannon.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.44,1:58:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what now?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.52,1:58:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷你版的死星技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miniaturized Death Star tech.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.08,1:58:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能像小鸡破壳一样 炸开大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll crack that door open like an egg.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.60,1:58:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一定有出路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be a back way out of here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.56,1:58:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,BB-8 你有找到什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.16,1:58:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,BB-8 分析了这座地矿的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}BB-8 has analyzed the mine's schematics.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.52,1:58:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门是唯一的进出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only way in or out.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.00,1:58:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.00,1:58:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有同盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have allies.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.48,1:58:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,盟友信任莱娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}People believe in Leia.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.00,1:58:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们收到信号后 一定会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll get our message, they'll come.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.12,1:58:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们要争取时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to buy time.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.32,1:58:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须摧毁那些大炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta take out that cannon.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.28,1:58:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}On me! On me!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.48,1:58:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.80,1:58:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去收集武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back! Gather your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.32,1:58:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.92,1:58:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.20,1:59:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.36,1:59:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面部队 敌方有动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground forces, incoming.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.80,1:59:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我们马上到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. On our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.88,1:59:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动你的雪橇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engage your mono-ski.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.20,1:59:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色的开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}The green toggle.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.80,1:59:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家都听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.16,1:59:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些生锈的废铁不好用 我们的胜算也很低 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like these rust buckets and I don't like our odds, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.76,1:59:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.24,1:59:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,先保持队形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep it tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.68,2:00:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大炮开启之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and don't get drawn in too.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.79,2:00:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要飞得太靠近敌方\N{\fnArial\fs30}close till they roll that cannon out front.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.52,2:00:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面部队 向敌方开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, ground forces, lay down some fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.80,2:00:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,十三架轻型飞行艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirteen incoming light craft.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.84,2:00:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要不要先解决他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we hold until we clear them?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.96,2:00:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 抵抗军就在那地矿中\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. The Resistance is in that mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.36,2:00:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前推进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push through.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.36,2:00:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗机 散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighters, break off!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.96,2:01:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 我们得拖住他们发射大炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! We gotta hold them till they pull up that cannon!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.28,2:01:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝 你的后方有三个敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose, you got three right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.20,2:01:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甩不掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lose 'em!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.32,2:01:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.04,2:01:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.60,2:02:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那垃圾飞船 给我从天上炸下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow that piece of junk out of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.88,2:02:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有战斗机\N{\fnArial\fs30}All fighters!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.40,2:02:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,邱伊 快离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, peel off from the battle.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.24,2:02:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,转移他们的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw them away from the speeders.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.40,2:02:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把所有的战斗机都带跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She drew 'em off! All of 'em!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.20,2:02:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可恨那艘飞船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they hate that ship!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.40,2:02:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,邱伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.76,2:03:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.96,2:03:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这炮真是巨大\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a big gun.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.24,2:03:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的装甲非常厚重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's heavily armored.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.68,2:03:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,直击炮口是唯一的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only shot is right down the throat.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.48,2:03:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大炮要开启了 我们的机会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cannon's opening. This is our chance.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.40,2:03:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,火力集中在那些飞行艇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All firepower on those speeders.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.76,2:03:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中射击飞行艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate all fire on the speeders!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.08,2:03:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们损失惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking heavy losses.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.92,2:04:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在逐个击毁击毁我们 我们没有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're picking us all off. We're not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.96,2:04:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一波进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, making my final approach.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.84,2:04:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标已瞄准 枪支准备发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target in sight, guns are hot.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.40,2:04:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Pull off!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.80,2:04:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.04,2:04:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,大炮已经启动了 你这么做是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cannon is charged! It's a suicide run!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.60,2:04:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有飞行艇 撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}All craft, pull away!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.12,2:04:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我马上就要到了 - 快撤退 芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! I'm almost there! - Retreat, Finn!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.36,2:04:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.60,2:04:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬恩 太迟了 不要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finn? It's too late! Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.92,2:04:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不会让他们赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I won't let them win!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.96,2:04:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 芬恩 听波的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Finn, listen to Poe!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.08,2:04:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to retreat!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.56,2:04:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,大炮正在预热期\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cannon is warming up now.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.16,2:04:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我们看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. We see it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.52,2:04:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备攻击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preparing to fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.08,2:05:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快点逃离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Go, go! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.08,2:05:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.16,2:05:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.00,2:05:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.52,2:05:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rose?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.84,2:05:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要那么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.76,2:05:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差一点就要成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was almost there.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.44,2:05:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要阻止我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you stop me?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.68,2:06:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved you,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.84,2:06:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}dummy.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.96,2:06:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们才能够胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.80,2:06:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是抵抗我们所恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not fighting what we hate,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.64,2:06:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是拯救我们所爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving what we love.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.44,2:06:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫克斯舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Hux,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.96,2:06:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}advance.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.96,2:06:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,斩草除根\N{\fnArial\fs30}No quarter.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.96,2:06:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不留俘虏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.28,2:06:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的求救信号已被多方接收\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our distress signal's been received at multiple points,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.68,2:06:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有任何回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no response.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.32,2:06:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们听到了我们的呼救\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've heard us,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.44,2:06:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不愿伸出援手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no one's coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.92,2:06:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们战斗到了最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought till the end.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.40,2:07:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是银河系 已失去了希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the galaxy has lost all its hope.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.72,2:07:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星之火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spark.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.08,2:07:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,已然熄灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}is out.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.16,2:07:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.16,2:07:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你准备说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.96,2:07:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我换了发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}I changed my hair.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.80,2:07:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice that way.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.32,2:07:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leia,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.12,2:08:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.32,2:08:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.36,2:08:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.36,2:08:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能够回来我已经很满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.24,2:08:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the end.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.20,2:08:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来面对他的 莱娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to face him, Leia.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.04,2:08:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无力拯救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't save him.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.64,2:08:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来 我都怀着希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I held out hope for so long,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.68,2:08:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我明白我的儿子已经消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know my son is gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.12,2:08:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会真正的消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever really gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.44,2:09:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Luke.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.32,2:09:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.96,2:10:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我把所有枪支对准那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every gun we have to fire on that man.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.64,2:10:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.76,2:10:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}More!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.16,2:10:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}More!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.72,2:10:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.80,2:10:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.92,2:10:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你伤到他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you got him?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.88,2:11:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 如果现在继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if we're ready to get moving,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.88,2:11:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能了断这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can finish this.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.24,2:11:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.84,2:11:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我放下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me down to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.52,2:11:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门关紧 没我的命令不准前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the door covered and don't advance until I say.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:36.44,2:11:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme Leader,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.88,2:11:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要分心 我们的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't get distracted, our goal…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.88,2:11:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.24,2:11:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,急救队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Med pack!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.96,2:11:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要急救队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a med pack!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.20,2:11:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她伤得很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's hurt pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.00,2:12:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是凯洛·伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Kylo Ren.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:10.48,2:12:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克独自一人面对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke's facing him alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.84,2:12:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们应该去支援 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we should help him. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.40,2:12:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.04,2:12:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来告诉我 你原谅我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you come back to say you forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.40,2:12:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拯救我的灵魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save my soul?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.04,2:12:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.52,2:12:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这样做是别有用心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's doing this for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.60,2:13:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在为我们争取逃离时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's stalling so we can escape.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.44,2:13:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escape?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.52,2:13:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他单枪匹马对抗一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one man against an army.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:04.68,2:13:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要帮助他 继续战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to help him, we have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.36,2:13:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们是燎原的星星之火\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. We are the spark that'll light the fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.64,2:13:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是烧毁第一秩序的大火\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'll burn the First Order down.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.36,2:13:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者这么做 是要保存火种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skywalker's doing this so we can survive.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.60,2:13:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地矿一定有其他的出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a way out of this mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:16.16,2:13:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然他是怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, how did he get in here?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:17.48,2:13:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 确实可能存在一条未被发现的出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, it is possible that a natural unmapped opening exists.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.72,2:13:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里是一座迷宫 拥有无数条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this facility is such a maze of endless tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.84,2:13:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够找到出口的概率\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the odds of finding an exit.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.64,2:13:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是一万五千四百二十八 - 嘘 别说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- are 15, 428… - Shh. Shush. Hush. Shush up.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.40,2:13:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.16,2:13:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 分之一 - 听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To one. - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.56,2:13:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的音频感受器 已经察觉不到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My audio sensors no longer detect the…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.96,2:13:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.92,2:13:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,水晶狐都跑去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd the crystal critters go?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:54.32,2:13:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.88,2:14:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都看着我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at me for?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.00,2:14:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow him.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.12,2:14:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果信标在下方 他们一定就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the beacon's right beneath us, they've got to be somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.76,2:14:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep scanning for life forms.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.08,2:14:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:35.16,2:14:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他们了 邱伊 在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see them! Chewie, there!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.48,2:14:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.76,2:14:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.00,2:15:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,搬走石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lifting rocks.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.92,2:15:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我辜负了你 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed you, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.28,2:15:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 你当然对不起我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - I'm sure you are!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.80,2:16:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗军已被消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Resistance is dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.04,2:16:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war is over.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.80,2:16:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I kill you,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.96,2:16:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就杀死了最后的绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have killed the last Jedi.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.56,2:16:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.24,2:16:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚你所说的每一句话 都是错误的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every word of what you just said was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:15.36,2:16:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,起义军在今日得到了重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rebellion is reborn today.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:20.68,2:16:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.84,2:16:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}is just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:25.72,2:16:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会是最后的绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will not be the last Jedi.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.40,2:17:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会毁灭她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll destroy her,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.60,2:17:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.80,2:17:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all of it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.28,2:17:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:21.40,2:17:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便你愤怒地向我挥刀 我也会一直在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike me down in anger and I'll always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:27.28,2:17:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父亲也是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like your father.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:18.80,2:18:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.12,2:18:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,后会有期 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around, kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:39.92,2:18:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.76,2:21:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'ai!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:20.88,2:21:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.20,2:21:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,邱伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:26.24,2:21:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks good.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:28.44,2:21:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在是疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was crazy, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:31.04,2:21:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.12,2:21:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是波\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Poe.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:35.00,2:21:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rey.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:36.36,2:21:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:49.72,2:21:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们抵达外环 我有熟人在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we get to the Outer Rim, I have a contact there.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.80,2:21:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite definitely possible.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:03.52,2:22:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke is gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.88,2:22:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.88,2:22:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没有丝毫悲伤或痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't sadness or pain.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:11.00,2:22:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有平静和决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was peace and purpose.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:14.28,2:22:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也感受到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it, too.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:18.28,2:22:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在该如何重建起义军呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we build a Rebellion from this?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.64,2:22:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经万事俱备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have everything we need.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:48.00,2:22:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克·天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke Skywalker,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.96,2:22:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jedi Master.
